        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "Anthropic recently filed for an [Initial Public Offering (IPO)](https://www.anthropic.com/news/s1-sec) and some buyers are discussing a valuation of over \\$1.1 trillion. Trillion Dollars.\n",
        "\n",
        "![](images/9296b1f811cfb7d5ff8054df531d77d1a5a8866bae672092531b7477007d440b.jpg)\n",
        "\n",
        "I was reading through it's [S-1 filling](https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2130357/000162828026067168/anthropicpbc-sx1.htm) on EDGAR and as I was skimming through the document, I came across the 'Risk Factors' section. This section includes information about significant risks that the company faces, generally listed in order of importance. I knew that 'Risk Factors' is present in [Annual 10-K reports](https://www.investor.gov/introduction-investing/getting-started/researching-investments/how-read-10-k), but to see one in a S-1 filing was news to me. But more importantly, I was curious to see how Anthropic describes the risks it faces.\n",
        "\n",
        "If you go to page 27 of the S-1 filing, you are greeted by a huge disclaimer that reads as follows:\n",
        "\n",
        "> The disclosures in this section reflect our beliefs and opinions as to matters that could materially and adversely affect us in the future, and are not representations as to whether such matters have or have not occurred previously, except as otherwise disclosed. References to past events are provided by way of example only and are not intended to be a complete listing or a representation as to their likelihood of occurring in the future. Our business, financial condition, results of operations, or prospects could also be adversely affected by risks and uncertainties not currently known to us or that we currently do not believe are material. If any of the risks actually occur, our business, financial condition, results of operations, and prospects could be adversely affected. In that event, the market price of our Class A common stock could decline, and you could lose part or all of your investment.\n",
        "\n",
        "Now I know the 'Risk Factors' section is not indicative of the actual risks that Anthropic faces. But nevertheless, I was curious to do a very basic Natural Language Processing (NLP) analysis of this section to see if I could identify any key insights, trends or anything that might be of value. Plus I thought it would be a good excuse to try out [Edgartools](https://edgartools.readthedocs.io/en/latest/), an open source Python package that I recently came across and is used for accessing, analysing and extracting insights from SEC filings.\n",
        "\n",
        "First step was accessing the S-1 filing. This [documentation page](https://edgartools.readthedocs.io/en/latest/guides/registration-s1-data-object-guide/?h=1+s) was really helpful."
      ],
      "id": "9ab35fef"
    },
